* **Standardization:** Many dish names have inconsistent formatting (e.g., underscores, double hyphens, capitalization). Regex can help us standardize these variations into a consistent format for accurate counting.
* **Removal of Irrelevant Information:** Some entries include extra details like preparation methods or sauces. Regex can be used to extract just the core dish name.

